exports[`git.branch.catchup lock refresh given: [case6b] main and the branch both add a dep at one spot; package.json conflicts too when: [t0] begin, take --whos main pnpm-lock.yaml, then lock refresh then: matches snapshot 1`] = `
"✋ ConstraintError: a manifest is still in conflict

🐚 git.branch.catchup lock refresh
   ├─ settle first
   │  └─ package.json
   ├─ why: a refresh reads package.json as is; with conflict markers it writes a wrong lock
   └─ next
      ├─ remove the <<<<<<< ======= >>>>>>> lines from each file
      ├─ settle each file:  rhx git.stage.add <file>
      └─ then:              rhx git.branch.catchup lock refresh
"
`;

