`;

exports[`git.branch.catchup lock refresh given: [case26d] a merge of origin/main in flight on main itself when: [t0] lock refresh then: matches snapshot: under the lock refresh header 1`] = `
"✋ ConstraintError: will not catch up main

🐚 git.branch.catchup lock refresh
   ├─ branch: main
   ├─ why: this verb levels a feature branch with main; it never writes to main or master
   └─ fix: back the merge out with rhx git.branch.catchup abort, then run from your feature branch
"
`;
